   | " text " hint(print "#%#")
   | text
   | apply
   | key
   | actions
   | state
   | entries
   | type
   | priority
   | . nonTypeName
   | this
   | ...
   | unop expression
   | expression binop expression
   | expression ? expression : expression
   | ( type ) expression
   | {#}
   | { dataElementExpression trailingCommaOpt }
